# From the posts of 2022-10-03, 2022-10-04, 2023-06-06 and 2023-08-16
# (studies/data/notes/pulled-israel-put-away.html), in the author's words.

=== Introduction
--- Israel Put Away [title]
overline: From the channel
heading: Israel Put Away
sub: The Bill of Divorcement
refs: Jeremiah 3:8; Ezekiel 16:48; Matthew 28:15; 1 Thessalonians 2:16
hint: Use the arrow keys or swipe to move through the slides. Tap any gold reference to read the verse.

=== Matthew 28
--- Commonly reported among the Jews
lead: The final chapter of Matthew, dealing with the resurrection, is less detailed than other Gospel accounts but contains insights not found elsewhere.
p: The key of which is the establishment of the conspiracy by the chief priests to claim Jesus' body was taken by His disciples, as Matthew writes:
big: Matthew 28:15 | mark: this saying is commonly reported among the Jews until this day
p: And that remains true.

--- Antichrists are liars
p: Jews publish such claims every few years, and repeat them daily seeking to provoke and sow doubt among believers. Antichrists are liars and they spend an inordinate amount of time, money and effort to discredit the Gospels and Jesus being the Christ.
p: They've formed an entire identity and religion out of denying this, reprobation being the fruit of their blasphemy.
p: Judas-ism, the 6th century antichrist cult of Babylonian mysticism exists to distort God's word and attack His promise, to undermine and subvert.
big: 1 John 2:22

=== 1 Thessalonians 2
--- Paul doesn't mince words
lead: Of the Jews, Paul doesn't mince words;
scripture: 1 Thessalonians 2:15-16 | mark: the wrath is come upon them to the uttermost

--- This is who they are
p: This is still true of the Jews today. This is who they are and why they are like they are, regardless of the origin story we might believe.
p: Regardless which Keyser Söze Jewish myth they perpetuate regarding who they are, the truth is that God's wrath is upon them to the uttermost, because they do not please Him, prevent Gentiles from hearing the truth of Jesus, and are contrary to all men.
p: Edomite, Khazarian, Ashkenaz, Cain, Canaanite; Adamic or not. This is who they are.
callout: It is important to recognize the biblical perspective, as it cuts through the noise and gets down to what matters. They are a synagogue of Satan. [[Revelation 2:9]]

=== Ezekiel 16
--- Worse than Sodom
lead: In Ezekiel 16, as the Lord speaks through the prophet to condemn Judah and put away the children of Israel as His beloved for her fornication, with the promise of her destruction and the new covenant of Christ, we see their sin compared to that of Sodom's, and it is worse for her whoredoms.
p: Going after strange gods, murdering their children and offering sacrifice and incense to idols made of men. [[Ezekiel 16:20-21]]
p: If you recall our recent series on Exodus, you may recognize how God describes His decking of the figurative Israel in skins and linens, gold and precious stones, the same as the Tabernacle He had Moses build. [[Ezekiel 16:10-13]]

--- A bill of divorcement
lead: This is a bill of divorcement, and should give the Zionist dispensationalist crowd cause to repent.
p: But I want to focus on the sin of Sodom compared to the sins laid at the feet of the children of Judah.

--- The iniquity of thy sister Sodom
scripture: Ezekiel 16:46-50 | mark: thou wast corrupted more than they in all thy ways; Sodom thy sister hath not done

--- Sisters of Sodom
p: God, having laid out their sin, and that in their pride they say they aren't as wicked as the Canaanites, or as Sodom, He reminds them they are of the land of Canaan; their father Abraham was an Amorite, and mother Sarah an Hittite. [[Ezekiel 16:3]]
lead: And so they are sisters of Sodom.

--- Doing it for free
p: And for all the abominations and pride of Sodom, who God rightly saw fit to destroy and kill all those wicked people, God is more offended by His chosen people, His intended bride.
- Not only fornicating after strange gods.
- Not only passing the children He blessed them with through the fire.
- Not only taking their riches and the sacrifices that are His and giving them to idols, going after outlandish gods and people.
lead: But doing it for free. Out of insatiable self-indulgence. Not as for hire like most harlots, but just to do it. [[Ezekiel 16:33-34]]

--- His real wrath
p: It is incredibly important that we Christians, and those who call themselves Christian, recognize during this month of "pride" and filthy reprobates being rebuked for their unnatural lusts, to remember that while God hates sodomites, and has them fit for destruction, His real wrath is kindled in our own apostasy, our own whoredoms. Our own fornication.
panel-warn: More than Sodom | God hates the great whore, the Roman Catholic Church, the Orthodox Church, and other harlot daughters, *more* than Sodom.
p: Unfaithfulness of those claiming to be His intended is more wicked than the filth of Sodom. And the wrath against them will be as it were against Israel, against Judah. Against Sodom and Gomorrah, and worse.

=== Jeremiah 3
--- I had put her away
big: Jeremiah 3:8 | mark: I had put her away, and given her a bill of divorce
p: This ties in with the study of Jeremiah. Jews, modern people calling themselves Jews, are defined by their rejection of Jesus as the Christ.
p: Regardless of genetic background, origin story, current ideology or religion, or anything else, a Jew is defined by their utter rejection of Christ and the God of their fathers.

--- The unfaithful wife and the new wife
panel-warn: The unfaithful wife | And by this, they are as the unfaithful wife, gone a whoring after false gods and badmouthing their former Husband, Who has put them away and taken to Him another people, who believe on His word. And call upon the name of the Lord.
callout: There can be no peace with these people. Just as an ex-wife of a bitter divorce cannot have peace with the new wife, loyal and true. Sealed by the Spirit and circumcised of the heart with the circumcision made without hands. [[Ephesians 1:13]]

